From: Foundry <hi@m7.rs>
Subject: [PATCH] support opt-in Generic OAuth back-channel logout

Bind verified OIDC identities to local sessions and persist monotonic logout
cutoffs, independent of refresh-token enforcement and provider availability.
See the included backchannel-logout.md for configuration and rollout notes.

